      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/bb73d2/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-03-16T04:26:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;SlenderTroll&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"SlenderTroll\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I think Baron Blade in any environment <span class=\"bbcode-i\">except</span> Mars is confusing. Wouldn’t he kill himself if he crashed the moon into his own planet?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>See, Baron Blade <span class=\"bbcode-i\">on</span> Mars confuses me. Is he dropping Phobos and/or Demos on the heroes? If he succeeds in dropping the moon, why does everyone just stop, otherwise? They could be rationalizing that humanity’s down to the 3-6 of them, I suppose, but would that necessarily stop, for example, the vendetta between Blade and Legacy?</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
