      "created_at": "2012-03-30T16:25:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Baron Blade is crazy, and all of his schemes are to one extent or another self destructive.</p>\n<p>In terms of Spite… see… there was this colony ship that crashed, and the survivors formed a commune in an abandoned Mars base.  Then!  Spite, the serial killer was sent into exile in space… you get the idea <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
